contract Statements
parties issuer, supplier, bank

asset Note
  amount HKD
  tier number
  holder supplier

can pledge to bank by supplier with reason text, limit HKD
  requires consent of bank and not frozen
  over HKD 1_000_000 requires in person
  AI agent can propose
  bank can approve
  if tier < 2 reject "the tier is too low"
  otherwise if tier < 4
    holder = bank
    active, frozen -> pledged
  otherwise
    -> pledged
  each part in parts
    requires part > HKD 0
  notify bank and issuer pays
